dalia-learning-resource:06d854f9-7532-4aea-9cec-869699bd1c73 a ec:EducationalResource ;
    dcterms:description "This is part of the 1st tutorial in the NOMAD virtual tutorial series. This is on the NOMAD Repository and Archive. You find the web-site for the tutorial here: https://th.fhi-berlin.mpg.de/meetings... This is the introduction video, where NOMAD Developer Markus Scheidgen explains what NOMAD is and what role NOMAD components like the Repository and Archive play. Before you start to watch the other tutorial videos and do the exercises, we recommend to watch this introduction. It will give you a brief overview of NOMAD, its various parts and functionality as well as some nomenclature. You find the web-based user interface to the official NOMAD Repository and Archive here: http://nomad-lab.eu/prod/rae" ;
