dalia-learning-resource:42c602b0-5649-454a-987c-554e004b2398 a ec:EducationalResource ;
    dcterms:description """We present legal and ethical issues using data in the agricultural research domain concerning the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR). In this regard, we also define the difference between anonymization and pseudonymization and their effect on the data subject.

This presentation was held during the Netzwerktreffen Forschungsdatenmanagement Berlin - Brandenburg in Potsdam, Germany on September 21st 2023.""" ;
    dcterms:format "PDF" ;
    dcterms:language <http://lexvo.org/id/iso639-3/deu> ;
    dcterms:license <http://spdx.org/licenses/CC-BY-4.0> ;
    dcterms:title "Der Umgang mit Forschungsdaten im Einklang mit Recht und Ethik - ein Fallbeispiel" ;
