dalia-learning-resource:45caa283-2e8c-439e-bd93-3dcd659e23c2 a ec:EducationalResource ;
    dcterms:description """This is the fifth Deep Learning Train-the-Trainer Workshop organized by the ErUM-Data-Hub with the support of DIG-UM.
Aim of this workshop is to educate lecturers for future teaching activities and to provide material to give lecture series on deep learning, including hands-on-exercises. Covered topics will be Neural Network Building Blocks & Mastering Model Building, Convolutional Neural Networks & Graph Convolutions and Generative Models. 
This workshop is addressed to scientists from all ErUM communities with prior knowledge of neural networks with an academic level of postdoc or higher. 
All attendees should be willing to give deep learning lectures at schools and workshops in the future.
A fee of 80€ will be charged for participation in the workshop.
You can find reviews of past workshops here.""" ;
    dcterms:language <http://lexvo.org/id/iso639-3/eng> ;
    dcterms:license mo:ProprietaryLicense ;
    dcterms:title "Deep Learning - Train-the-Trainer Workshop" ;
    mo:hasCommunity dalia-community:616d9b09-1f05-4847-b269-510479dec39b ;
    schema:url <https://indico.desy.de/event/40586/> .

