dalia-learning-resource:4c75e9eb-e66d-48a4-937c-2ad4915ad20e a ec:EducationalResource ;
    dcterms:description "This is part of the 1st tutorial in the NOMAD virtual tutorial series. This is on the NOMAD Repository and Archive. You find the web-site for the tutorial here: https://th.fhi-berlin.mpg.de/meetings... Here we learn how to install the NOMAD Python package and how to parse and process locally on your computer. This will allow you to use NOMAD's parsers without NOMAD. This will also enable you to improve the parsers and make contributions to NOMAD." ;
