dalia-learning-resource:528fa701-4fdf-480a-a90f-f88e63239fb3 a ec:EducationalResource ;
    dcterms:description "In the realm of science, not every connection is readily apparent. Within NFDI4Cat, we leverage ontologies to represent the wisdom derived from catalysis and related research. 🧠 Ontologies are more than just structured representations of knowledge and concepts; they're the scaffolding upon which groundbreaking research is built. In catalysis and related sciences, they provide a common language for scientists to navigate complex data and unlock hidden insights. ❓But what exactly are ontologies, and why are they so crucial in the field of catalysis and catalysis-related sciences?" ;
    dcterms:language <http://lexvo.org/id/iso639-3/eng> ;
    dcterms:license mo:ProprietaryLicense ;
    dcterms:title "Ontologies" ;
    ns1:authorUnordered [ a schema:Organization ;
            schema:name "NFDI4Cat" ] ;
    mo:hasCommunity dalia-community:7783f91b-2496-4c1b-97ef-9db578d237ca ;
