dalia-learning-resource:635a8ce2-141c-403e-b1f2-f9c4b6307bad a ec:EducationalResource ;
    dcterms:description "If you publish and long term archive your data with PANGAEA (https://www.pangaea.de/), they will become findable, accessible, interoperable and reusable following the FAIR principles. Submitting data to PANGAEA is rather easy, all you need is your data, some additional information called metadata, and the willingness to open up your data to the world. PANGAEA is a fully curated data repository, so once you take the initial step by uploading your data (https://www.pangaea.de/submit/), experienced data curators are going to help you personally through the further submission process." ;
    dcterms:language <http://lexvo.org/id/iso639-3/eng> ;
    dcterms:license mo:ProprietaryLicense ;
    dcterms:title "How to publish FAIR Data with PANGAEA. - Data Publisher for Earth & Environmental Science" ;
