dalia-learning-resource:63663481-d8a6-4224-90b7-da40b9b34ee7 a ec:EducationalResource ;
    dcterms:description "In this training you will learn about a number of tools and services that are developed and/or widely used by the PUNCH communities. The selection of these tools has be performed to meet the needs and expectations of the early-stage career scientists in PUNCH4NFDI consortium. The tools will be explored in a thrilling alternation of explanation, discussion and practical sessions." ;
