dalia-learning-resource:6e0e643c-50f1-47f9-99cf-de30a09455f9 a ec:EducationalResource ;
    dcterms:description "📊 In the dynamic world of science, the efficient management of research data is a game-changer. Metadata serves as the backbone of comprehensive data management, allowing researchers in catalysis to organize, share, and interpret their valuable data more effectively. It's the compass that guides us in this intricate research journey. 🌐 In a digital age, metadata makes research data more FAIR - Findable, Accessible, Interoperable, and Reusable. It's the key to unlocking hidden insights, fostering collaboration, and accelerating scientific discoveries. 🎬In this video, find out about the concept and importance of metadata and how it plays a key role in making your research data FAIR." ;
    dcterms:language <http://lexvo.org/id/iso639-3/eng> ;
    dcterms:license mo:ProprietaryLicense ;
    dcterms:title "Metadata" ;
