dalia-learning-resource:b0d1e97c-3eca-488b-9aab-95e60a09b32a a ec:EducationalResource ;
    dcterms:description "In the age of digital transformation, research is undergoing a remarkable evolution, and the Electronic Lab Notebook (ELN) is at the forefront of this revolution. 📈 ELNs are not just about replacing traditional paper notebooks; they're about elevating research data management to a whole new level. With ELNs, researchers in diverse fields are embracing efficiency, accessibility, and collaboration like never before. 🎬Dive into this video to explore the benefits of ELNs and how they can support you in maintaining sustainable and accessible documentation of your research!" ;
