dalia-learning-resource:c3dc81c4-c474-4137-9b67-a4f9231a38f7 a ec:EducationalResource ;
    dcterms:description "This is part of the 1st tutorial in the NOMAD virtual tutorial series. This is on the NOMAD Repository and Archive. You find the web-site for the tutorial here: https://th.fhi-berlin.mpg.de/meetings... Here we learn how to upload data to NOMAD and how to publish the uploaded data. We are covering 5 steps: preparing files, uploading, reviewing the upload, adding user metadata, publishing and creating a DOI." ;
