    dcterms:description "In this episode of “Conversations on AI Ethics”,  Prof. Dr. Wolf-Georg Ringe and Jaana Müller-Brehm continue to discuss the EU AI Act. How is the new law going to shape the AI industry? Is it going to solve many of the issues with AI? What are its limitations?" ;
